1
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:03,560
Ten years ago,

2
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:06,210
my master sealed this warding object.

3
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:07,960
Three months ago,

4
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,000
someone activated it again.

5
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,160
Being able to reconnect his seal

6
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:15,660
means the other party is very familiar with the same craft.

7
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:22,680
This is the last thing my master left me

8
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:24,160
before he disappeared.

9
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:26,650
I never understood this notch.

10
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:28,360
Now it seems

11
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:29,410
it's a signpost.

12
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:30,280
Master.

13
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:33,420
The craftsmen who replaced the beam for me back then

14
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:35,360
later went to Motan Village.

15
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:36,800
Motan Village

16
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:38,840
is forty miles west of Tongqiao.

17
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,600
They said they were going to repair the Mo Family Ancestral Hall.

18
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:43,800
Qinghe.

19
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:46,450
If one day you lose contact with me,

20
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:47,960
don't look for me.

21
00:00:48,520 --> 00:00:50,850
Some things are not as simple as you think.

22
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:53,420
Mo Family Ancestral Hall.

23
00:00:55,080 --> 00:00:55,880
Master.

24
00:00:56,680 --> 00:01:00,120
Your disappearance is related to the famous Mo family.

25
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:03,400
The warding object has been taken out.

26
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:04,879
The door ruler curse is broken.

27
00:01:04,879 --> 00:01:06,000
Starting tonight,

28
00:01:06,080 --> 00:01:07,610
nothing will happen again.

29
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:10,160
Master, this is the agreed payment.

30
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:11,220
You must accept it.

31
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:12,360
No need for money.

32
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:15,080
Take down this whole old beam tomorrow.

33
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:16,140
Give the wood to me.

34
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:29,760
Motan Village was abandoned thirty years ago.

35
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:31,560
Only the Mo Family Ancestral Hall is still there.

36
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:32,520
In the last three years,

37
00:01:32,520 --> 00:01:34,160
etiquette scholars have gone in to investigate one after another.

38
00:01:34,160 --> 00:01:35,120
Two people didn't come back.

39
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:36,180
You telling me this

40
00:01:36,440 --> 00:01:37,880
is to persuade me not to go.

41
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:39,009
I want to go with you.

42
00:01:39,039 --> 00:01:39,970
You are a Yanshi.

43
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:41,479
I can help you check work contracts,

44
00:01:41,479 --> 00:01:42,560
etiquette records and old files.

45
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:45,039
Motan Village might be much more dangerous than the door ruler curse,

46
00:01:45,039 --> 00:01:47,160
so you need someone who understands these things even more.

47
00:01:47,160 --> 00:01:49,200
What is your relationship with the Su family in the capital?

48
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,560
The current head of the family

49
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:51,320
is my father.

50
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:52,520
Okay.

51
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,280
But after we go in, listen to me on everything.

52
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,210
No acting alone.

53
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:57,300
No problem.

54
00:01:57,960 --> 00:01:58,820
Motan Village.

55
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:01,200
Master.

56
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:03,290
All these years,

57
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:04,770
where have you been?

58
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:12,820
The door of the Mo Family Ancestral Hall,

59
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:14,480
leave it for him.

60
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:32,680
Carving the Luban ruler backwards is a big taboo.

61
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:35,200
It's equal to sealing off the air vent of the whole ancestral hall.

62
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:36,400
You know quite a lot.

63
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:38,680
My teacher taught me.

64
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:41,800
He came here to investigate three years ago,

65
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,160
and never went back.

66
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:47,560
His shadow rubbing box was left in the hotel.

67
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:49,560
The last image in the box is this threshold.

68
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:52,620
The fingerprints on the black paint are newly printed.

69
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:59,360
This is the technique of Yanshi's dark arts.

70
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:01,560
The whole ancestral hall has been nourished by someone.

71
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:02,360
Nourished?

72
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:05,160
There is a formation under the ancestral hall,

73
00:03:05,160 --> 00:03:08,560
nourished by the vitality of the living or the obsession of the dead.

74
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:12,690
The things here are probably much more dangerous than the hotel door beam.

75
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:24,760
It really is Yanshi's dark arts.

76
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:26,200
Stand behind me.

77
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:37,860
The order has been corrected.

78
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:52,000
Putting a well directly behind the main door of the ancestral hall

79
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:53,520
doesn't conform to any architectural regulations.

80
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:56,450
Because this is not a door for people to walk through.

81
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:58,440
Master.

82
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,450
This is the first place.

83
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:02,560
Master.

84
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:04,280
I can feel Master's presence here.

85
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:06,200
Master Chen, what did you see?

86
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:08,120
Master's suppressing object is actually here.

87
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:10,120
But this formation is fiercer than I expected.

88
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,640
The suppressing object has been 70% penetrated.

89
00:04:11,640 --> 00:04:12,700
It won't last long.

90
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:18,480
Explore the well to find the living energy.

91
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:20,740
Don't touch anything carved with runes.

92
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:29,920
Qinghe.

93
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:32,400
Qinghe.

94
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:37,000
Master.

95
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:38,440
Master.

96
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:39,800
Where are you?

97
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:42,730
I've been looking for you all these years.

98
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,159
Qinghe.

99
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:46,000
Go down the well quickly

100
00:04:46,320 --> 00:04:47,850
and take the bronze mirror.

101
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:49,800
Are you going down?

102
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:51,360
The Soul-Capturing Mirror must be taken out.

103
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,920
Otherwise, my master will be in danger.

104
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,400
This is the clue my master left for me.

105
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:56,200
What if the well is full of traps?

106
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,360
I can handle it.

107
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,730
Stay here and don't wander around.

108
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:03,120
Okay, be careful.

109
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:22,560
What's wrong?

110
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,480
Are you okay?

111
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:28,840
Qinghe.

112
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:31,600
Under the Mo Family Ancestral Hall is buried the Hundred Evils Gathering Formation.

113
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:33,680
It's draining the vitality of the earth veins and living creatures

114
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:35,280
to nourish the Twelve Earthly Branches.

115
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:37,159
The bronze mirror is the core of the formation.

116
00:05:37,159 --> 00:05:38,090
How do I break it?

117
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:39,400
Break the bronze mirror

118
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,560
to let the evil energy flow back.

119
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:42,040
There are eight formation bases in the underground palace,

120
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,120
distributed according to the Eight Gates.

121
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,800
Seal them one by one using the Kan Trigram,

122
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:47,659
starting from the Gate of Fear and going backwards.

123
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:48,860
I'll handle it.

124
00:05:48,880 --> 00:05:49,840
The order cannot be wrong.

125
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:50,840
Break the Eight Gates.

126
00:05:50,840 --> 00:05:51,960
I'm fine for now.

127
00:05:51,960 --> 00:05:53,000
You must be careful.

128
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:53,880
The Mo family...

129
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:56,940
I'm going to disconnect. Break the formation quickly.

130
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,320
Rise.

131
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,080
How is it?

132
00:06:07,080 --> 00:06:08,080
I need to break the bronze mirror

133
00:06:08,080 --> 00:06:09,120
to destroy the formation here.

134
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:10,160
Leave the ancestral hall immediately.

135
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:10,880
The further, the better.

136
00:06:10,880 --> 00:06:12,410
I'll find you when I'm done.

137
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:13,280
Okay.

138
00:06:13,400 --> 00:06:14,320
Don't push yourself too hard.

139
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:15,040
Stay safe.

140
00:06:58,760 --> 00:06:59,400
Gate of Fear.

141
00:06:59,400 --> 00:07:00,400
Seal.

142
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:16,720
This is...

143
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,800
This is the teacher's handwriting.

144
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:21,680
Teacher.

145
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:53,800
Six gates broken in a row.
